[0.030, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠹\u001b[0m \u001b[2mthinking...\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "For each of the five counties, I divided the number of crashes rated fatal (the worst injury in the crash was a death) by that      \r\ncounty's total crashes, using the collisions table for 2001 to mid-2021. Riverside comes out highest. The checked answer is below.  \r\n"]
